#### branch-fed — the v2 case parallel/branch-fed, as a pull writes it
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
lamp := BRANCH(FEED := start, a, b AND LE(speed, 40), c);
=== model
NETWORK
  (:= lamp (par seq start a (AND b (LE speed 40 conn:0)) c))

