#### branch-of-enabled-comparisons — the v2 case parallel/branch-of-enabled-comparisons, as a pull writes it
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
%WIRES w1, w2, w3
GE_EN(EN := TRUE, pos, start, OUT => w2);
LE_EN(EN := w2, pos, stop, OUT => w1);
GT_EN(EN := TRUE, start, stop, OUT => w3);
cam := BRANCH_SHORTCIRCUIT(FEED := enable, w1, w3);
=== model
NETWORK
  (:= cam (par sc enable (LE pos stop en:(GE pos start en:TRUE conn:0) conn:0) (GT start stop en:TRUE conn:0)))

#### branch-per-line — the v2 case parallel/branch-per-line, as a pull writes it
=== text
